{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34012","headline":"寒夜文宴得泉字 · 皮日休","name":"寒夜文宴得泉字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分明竞襞七香牋，王郎风姿尽列仙。\n盈箧共开华顶药，满缾同坼惠山泉。\n蟹因霜重金膏溢，橘爲风多玉脑鲜。\n吟罢不知诗首数，隔林明月过中天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}